  "body": "A bug introduced in 0.25.0 by ffc574a6 meant that synapse would fail to start if you had the following config in your homeserver.yaml:\r\n\r\n```\r\nldap_config:\r\n    enabled: true\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe error was:\r\n\r\n```\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/config/password_auth_providers.py\", line 34, in read_config\r\nTypeError: 'builtin_function_or_method' object has no attribute '__getitem__'\r\n```\r\n",
